SETTLE OUTPUT — redesign to checkpoints/ + evaluation_results/.

The default run (COMPAT=symlink) needs NO code edits: backward-compat symlinks at every
old path keep all references resolving. The edits below are ONLY needed if you run with
COMPAT=none to get a fully symlink-free tree.

NEW PATHS:
  output/GRDR/<ds>/...            -> output/checkpoints/GRDR/<ds>/...
  output/GRDR/bucket_candidate_k20/msrvtt/<run>
                                  -> output/checkpoints/GRDR/msrvtt/bucket_candidate_k20/<run>
  output/GRDR/panda/...           -> output/checkpoints/GRDR/panda/...
  output/GRDR_P6/panda/...        -> output/checkpoints/GRDR/panda/p6/...
  output/GRDR/multiview_waas/...  -> output/checkpoints/GRDR/panda/multiview_waas/...
  # Baseline is model -> dataset; method names unified to avg(=text_guided), tiger(=standard), videorqvae, eercf, t2vindexer
  output/baseline/<ds>/text_guided -> output/checkpoints/Baseline/avg/<ds>
  output/baseline/<ds>/standard    -> output/checkpoints/Baseline/tiger/<ds>
  output/baseline/<ds>/videorqvae  -> output/checkpoints/Baseline/videorqvae/<ds>
  output/baseline/panda-pretrain/avg        -> output/checkpoints/Baseline/avg/panda
  output/baseline/panda-pretrain/tiger      -> output/checkpoints/Baseline/tiger/panda
  output/baseline/panda-pretrain/eercf      -> output/checkpoints/Baseline/eercf/panda
  output/baseline/panda-pretrain/t2vindexer -> output/checkpoints/Baseline/t2vindexer/panda
  output/semantic-tvr-progressive -> output/checkpoints/_legacy/semantic-tvr-progressive
  output/reranker/...             -> output/evaluation_results/rerank/...
  output/ann_baseline/...         -> output/evaluation_results/ann_baseline/...
  output/ann_latency/...          -> output/evaluation_results/latency/ann_latency/...
  output/ann_stage2_compare/...   -> output/evaluation_results/latency/ann_stage2_compare/...
  output/latency_recall_figure/.. -> output/evaluation_results/figures/...
  output/xpool_t2v_eval/...       -> output/evaluation_results/rerank/xpool_t2v_eval/...

Do NOT touch AGENTS.md:99 — that path is under var/research/.../output/GRDR/..., not this output/ tree.

